# ANCHOR: run
$ cd greet
$ z42 run
你好，世界！
# ANCHOR_END: run
# ANCHOR: plain
$ cd ../plain
$ z42 publish
z42b publish: ./z42.toml is not configured to publish a desktop apphost — add `apphost = true` under [platform.desktop]
[exit: 2]
# ANCHOR_END: plain
# ANCHOR: toml
$ cd ../greet
$ cat z42.toml
[project]
name    = "greet"
version = "0.1.0"
kind    = "exe"

[sources]
include = ["src/**/*.z42"]

[platform.desktop]
apphost = true
# ANCHOR_END: toml
# ANCHOR: publish
$ z42 publish
z42b publish: desktop apphost not available (the apphost ships with the desktop workload).
       run: z42 workload install desktop
       (publish via `z42 publish` so the launcher resolves the installed workload apphost;
        or declare `[build] hooks` with a ProjectHooks that registers an apphost-stub output.)
[exit: 1]
# ANCHOR_END: publish
# ANCHOR: list
$ z42 workload list
(no workloads installed)
# ANCHOR_END: list
# ANCHOR: export
$ z42 export --rid browser-wasm
z42 export wasm → ./greet-wasm
...
$ ls greet-wasm
index.html
index.js
